Z||000000||saleenfiero||07-03-2001||12:44 PM||||I've never been able to get into my passenger door on my car, they key goes in, but it refuses to turn.  Now lately my drivers side has been giving me grief, sometimes not allowing me to even get the key in all the way, I tried to look at it and can see a little spring in the lock and I try to get around that.  Any ideas on what's wrong or what I can do.||||reg||1
